    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d989">

                <pb facs="1122" n="1026" xml:id="pg1026"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Lee to Mr.
                            Day.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Havana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-01-24"><hi rendition="#italic">January 24,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Advise visit be postponed six or seven days, to give last excitement more time to
                    disappear. Will see authorities and let you know result. Governor-General away
                    for two weeks. I should know day and hour visit.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
